Polyfin distributes Figtree, unmodified, in two places:

- The admin app, at /admin/: its build takes the package from npm
  (web/package.json) and embeds its font files in Polyfin, served with
  the app's other assets.
- The page of share links, at /share/{token}: Polyfin embeds two files of
  the package, files/figtree-latin-wght-normal.woff2 and
  files/figtree-latin-ext-wght-normal.woff2, at
  internal/jellyfin/share/assets/, and serves them at /share/assets/.

Neither loads anything from elsewhere.

Source: https://github.com/erikdkennedy/figtree
